        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 10:32 p.m. Central Daylight Time Sunday, Environment Canada has ended a tornado warning for Westman Manitoba.  Brandon, Forrest, Chater and Oakland-Wawanesa. Tornadoes associated with this alert are no longer expected in the area. </value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
